  "releaseNotes": "1.9.2: Add YAML Protocol Packs and source generation, Modbus TCP/RTU and PLC tags, MELSEC framing, TLS/mTLS, secure OPC UA and MQTT subscriptions. Harden alarm classification, bounded telemetry delivery, decoder progress and connection cleanup. Support .NET 8/10 across industrial integrations. Includes documented Modbus/PLC enhancements, TLS, bounded MQTT/OPC UA subscriptions, secure OPC UA options and .NET 8 support for Modbus/MQTT/OPC UA.",
